<title>USA: Aviron completes 2.4 mln shr offering.</title>
<headline>Aviron completes 2.4 mln shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aviron Wednesday said it has completed a public offering of 2.4 million common shares at $27 per share.</p>
<p>All the shares were sold by the company.</p>
<p>The offering was managed by Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co LLC, Bear, Stearns &amp; Co Inc, and Hambrecht &amp; Quist LLC.</p>
<p>Aviron is a biopharmaceutical company focused on the prevention of disease through innovative vaccine technology.</p>
